    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71320" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύσσα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ης</span>, ἡ, in a race-course, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			
